{"ticker":"TRV","updated":"2026-10-24T00:21:30Z","profile":{"longName":"The Travelers Companies, Inc.","shortName":"The Travelers Companies, Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Property & Casualty","country":"United States","website":"https://www.travelers.com","fullTimeEmployees":34000,"marketCap":83071262720,"trailingPE":10.472785,"forwardPE":12.843466,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.6980696,"pegRatio":2.36,"targetMeanPrice":374.29166,"targetHighPrice":450.0,"targetLowPrice":262.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.005,"earningsGrowth":0.097,"grossMargins":0.34858,"operatingMargins":0.20037001,"profitMargins":0.17031999,"totalRevenue":48921001984,"beta":0.437,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":407.87,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":264.25,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.23},"summary":"The Travelers Companies, Inc., through its subsidiaries, provides a range of commercial and personal property, and casualty insurance products and services to businesses, government units, associations, and individuals in the United States, Canada, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Business Insurance, Bond & Specialty Insurance, and Personal Insurance. The Business Insurance segment offers workers' compensation, commercial automobile and property, general liability, commercial multi-peril, employers' liability, public and product liability, professional indemnity, marine, aviation, commercial property and automobile, onshore and offshore energy, construction, terrorism, personal accident, and kidnap and ransom insurance products. This segment operates through select accounts, which serve small businesses; middle accounts that serve mid-sized businesses; national accounts, which serve large companies; and national property and others that serve large and mid-sized customers, commercial trucking industry, and agricultural businesses, as well as markets and distributes its products through brokers, wholesale agents, and program managers. The Bond & Specialty Insurance segment provides surety, fidelity, management and professional liability, and other property and casualty coverages and related risk management services through independent agencies and brokers","summary_zh":"The Travelers Companies, Inc. 透過其子公司，向美國、加拿大和國際上的企業、政府單位、協會和個人提供一系列商業和個人財產以及傷亡保險產品和服務。它透過三個部門運作：商業保險、債券和專業保險以及個人保險。商業保險部門提供工人賠償、商業汽車和財產、一般責任、商業多重風險、雇主責任、公共和產品責任、專業賠償、海事、航空、商業財產和汽車、陸上和海上能源、建築、恐怖主義、個人事故以及綁架和贖金保險產品。該部門透過為小型企業提供服務的精選帳戶進行運作；為中型企業服務的中型帳戶；國民帳戶，為大公司服務；國家財產和其他為大中型客戶、商業卡車運輸業和農業企業提供服務的公司，以及透過經紀人、批發代理商和專案經理行銷和分銷其產品的公司。債券和專業保險部門透過獨立機構和經紀人提供擔保、保真、管理和專業責任以及其他財產和傷亡保險以及相關風險管理服務","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險 - 財產與意外傷害","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":275.3,"h":276.11,"l":272.15,"c":272.34,"v":1068700},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":271.38,"h":272.33,"l":270.44,"c":270.89,"v":2039600},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":270.57,"h":274.04,"l":270.24,"c":272.21,"v":808000},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":271.83,"h":272.42,"l":269.14,"c":270.28,"v":827900},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":270.4,"h":272.41,"l":269.91,"c":271.51,"v":681000},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":271.26,"h":273.61,"l":268.85,"c":273.35,"v":1408900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":272.11,"h":276.63,"l":270.64,"c":276.55,"v":1615600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":278.56,"h":280.7,"l":276.66,"c":279.43,"v":1239800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":279.04,"h":280.37,"l":273.96,"c":275.22,"v":970700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":275.46,"h":275.46,"l":271.34,"c":274.48,"v":843700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":273.86,"h":275.55,"l":272.27,"c":273.55,"v":1046600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":270.39,"h":272.42,"l":269.2,"c":272.33,"v":844400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":272.54,"h":279.75,"l":272.06,"c":279.43,"v":1089100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":278.63,"h":280.0,"l":277.89,"c":278.93,"v":852100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":278.19,"h":279.7,"l":276.1,"c":276.3,"v":805400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":274.88,"h":274.88,"l":270.68,"c":271.95,"v":2475000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":272.53,"h":276.8,"l":272.13,"c":275.03,"v":982300},{"t":"2025-0